#!/usr/bin/env bun
/**
 * nemesis.ts — the acos-nemesis-protocol command line. Thin SKILL.md, thick CLI (D-24).
 * Run `bun nemesis.ts help` for the command list. Every command that changes state writes
 * an artifact and a record; hooks check those files, never the model's word.
 */
